cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If Research Lab supports your work, you can cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Research Lab: AI research assistants for any field, built on BMad"
abstract: >-
  A BMad module of AI research assistants for researchers in any field. A fixed
  core team helps plan, search prior art, question, verify and document a
  project, and each project brings in the specialists, guardians, reporting
  standards and checks that its classification calls for. The researcher
  remains the author, and AI assistance is recorded for disclosure.
authors:
